{"about_the_game":"After opening a mysterious package, Shinji Ueda finds himself trapped on a deadly island and hunted by his past, with only one choice: survival. <strong>Perished Truth</strong>\u00a0is an adrenaline-fueled single-player survival horror game, blending classic &quot;Resident Evil&quot; and &quot;Saw&quot; influences with a highly customizable control scheme.[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152560/extras/0b27b2edb236d8cac9d38a057e8be1bd.avif?t=1766844066\" width=1560 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shinji's life was shattered after the death of his wife.\u00a0Desperate to save his terminally ill daughter from sharing the same fate as her mother, he turned to the dark web, crossing paths with forces far more dangerous than he ever imagined.\u00a0Now, hunted for sins he thought he left behind, Shinji wakes up trapped on a desolate island with other captives, each hiding dark secrets of their own.\u00a0To survive, he must endure a series of twisted trials... where failure means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152560/extras/165e6d947d2fda65de906f4ca70911f8.avif?t=1766844066\" width=1560 height=88 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perished Truth</strong> fuses classic fixed-camera, tank-control survival horror with modernized controls and aiming. Customize your experience to play your way. Explore a forgotten island, scavenge for weapons and supplies, and face off against the infected, and possibly, your fellow captives. Solve environmental puzzles, unlock new paths, and piece together the truth behind your captors... before time runs out and you become one of the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152560/extras/ff908024db1c690a8da1d1be158cb7ae.avif?t=1766844066\" width=1560 height=88 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic survival horror tension with modernized controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera angles with optional shoulder-camera perspective and first-person aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, inventory management, weapon upgrading, resource scavenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twisted puzzles with rewarding outcomes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152560?t=1766844066","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152560?t=1766844066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152560/bac0a92588a15bc1cbf2722427fe391d05603734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766844066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152560/bac0a92588a15bc1cbf2722427fe391d05603734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766844066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features depictions of violence and blood, implied suicide, and mild profanity. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4155300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Note</h1><p>Purchase of this base game includes the first full act, offering roughly 6-8 hours of ga